{
  "info": {
    "name": "Turnos Medicos - Semana 2",
    "description": "CRUD de sedes, especialidades, coberturas y agenda medica. Estructura de respuesta uniforme { codigo, estado, datos }. Proteccion por rol con verificarToken + verificarRol.\n\nUso: 1) ejecutar 'Login admin' (guarda token_admin), 'Login operador' (token_operador) y 'Login medico' (token_medico). 2) Probar el resto de los requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "token_admin", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token_operador", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token_medico", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var d = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (d.datos && d.datos.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', d.datos.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"18222333\",\n  \"password\": \"clinica123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login operador",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var d = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (d.datos && d.datos.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_operador', d.datos.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"15200548\",\n  \"password\": \"clinica123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login medico",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var d = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (d.datos && d.datos.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token_medico', d.datos.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"20111222\",\n  \"password\": \"clinica123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sedes (admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar sedes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear sede",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Sede Sur\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 9 111\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3424000003\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar sede",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Sede Sur Renovada\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 9 222\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3424000004\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes/3", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes", "3"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar sede (nueva, sin dependencias)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes/3", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes", "3"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar sede con dependencias (espera 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes", "1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar sedes con rol no admin (espera 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sedes", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sedes"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coberturas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar coberturas (publico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear cobertura (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"OSDE\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar cobertura (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"OSDE 210\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas/2", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas", "2"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar cobertura (nueva)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas/2", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas", "2"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar cobertura con dependencias (espera 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_admin}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas", "1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear cobertura con rol no admin (espera 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"NoPermitida\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/coberturas", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["coberturas"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Agenda medica",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear agenda (operador, cualquier medico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_operador}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"hora_entrada\": \"08:00\",\n  \"hora_salida\": \"12:00\",\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-11-10\",\n  \"id_medico\": 3,\n  \"id_especialidad\": 1,\n  \"id_sede\": 1\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear agenda (medico, su propia, 2do rango mismo dia)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"hora_entrada\": \"13:00\",\n  \"hora_salida\": \"17:00\",\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-11-10\",\n  \"id_medico\": 3,\n  \"id_especialidad\": 1,\n  \"id_sede\": 1\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear agenda de OTRO medico (medico, espera 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"hora_entrada\": \"08:00\",\n  \"hora_salida\": \"09:00\",\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-11-11\",\n  \"id_medico\": 1,\n  \"id_especialidad\": 1,\n  \"id_sede\": 1\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar agenda (operador, filtrado por sede y fecha)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_operador}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda?id_sede=1&fecha=2025-11-10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "id_sede", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "fecha", "value": "2025-11-10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar agenda (medico, solo la suya)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar agenda (operador)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_operador}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"hora_entrada\": \"08:30\",\n  \"hora_salida\": \"12:30\",\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-11-10\",\n  \"id_medico\": 3,\n  \"id_especialidad\": 1,\n  \"id_sede\": 1\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/3", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda", "3"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar agenda con turnos (espera 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_operador}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/2", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda", "2"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar agenda (operador)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_operador}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/3", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda", "3"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Agenda con rol paciente (espera 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token_medico}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["agenda"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
